[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4202.229, "timestamp": "01:10:02", "text": "比如说东京都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4205.189, "timestamp": "01:10:05", "text": "东西。别犹豫，漂白我吧。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4207.01, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4207.11, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "text": "出去，好吗？因为我非常非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4210.55, "timestamp": "01:10:10", "text": "用这种廉价的方式惹麻烦，好吗？不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4212.39, "timestamp": "01:10:12", "text": "关于它。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4213.446, "timestamp": "01:10:13", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "well thats 1 way to say welcome to someone, thanks saiko"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4214.229, "timestamp": "01:10:14", "text": "我非常兴奋地想告诉大家，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4216.189, "timestamp": "01:10:16", "text": "就像我见过的那样，你知道的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4218.39, "timestamp": "01:10:18", "text": "有影响力的人，以及像那些人一样的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4221.99, "timestamp": "01:10:21", "text": "比如创作类似的内容，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4224.07, "timestamp": "01:10:24", "text": "他们称之为他们创造"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4227.189, "timestamp": "01:10:27", "text": "适合喜欢这类人群的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4228.95, "timestamp": "01:10:28", "text": "你怎么能像这样到处乱跑呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4231.03, "timestamp": "01:10:31", "text": "呃。这从来都不是最便宜的方法。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4234.31, "timestamp": "01:10:34", "text": "从来都不是那种方便的方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4236.79, "timestamp": "01:10:36", "text": "便宜，但绝非最便宜的那种。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4238.229, "timestamp": "01:10:38", "text": "就像，“我的天哪，这简直太棒了”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4240.55, "timestamp": "01:10:40", "text": "便宜。” 从来不是那样。每次都是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4242.55, "timestamp": "01:10:42", "text": "我看到有人制作类似这样的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4244.07, "timestamp": "01:10:44", "text": "去日本，四处游览，该怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4245.35, "timestamp": "01:10:45", "text": "你从一个地方旅行到另一个地方吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4248.87, "timestamp": "01:10:48", "text": "这当然是最方便的方式，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4251.03, "timestamp": "01:10:51", "text": "它价格不菲。这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4252.63, "timestamp": "01:10:52", "text": "每当有人四处走动时，我总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4254.31, "timestamp": "01:10:54", "text": "比如告诉他们，“嘿，如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4256.39, "timestamp": "01:10:56", "text": "预算内，好的，请告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.07, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "因为我知道怎么四处闲逛"}]